This notice covers the repository tooling in `scripts/` and the documentation
in this repository. It does not cover the packages published from this
repository.

Each package in `packages/*.ark` is built from third-party upstream software
and remains under its own upstream license. The `License` field of the matching
`packages/recipes/<name>/ARKPKG` recipe records that license, and the archive
payload keeps the license or copyright files that the upstream project ships,
usually under `/usr/share/licenses/` or `/usr/share/doc/<name>/copyright`. Check
the recipe and the installed payload before redistributing a package.
